# Prisma Client Python generates into the installed package (no `output` set
# in backend/app/db/prisma/schema.prisma), i.e. inside .venv/ — already
# covered above. If schema.prisma ever sets an explicit `output` path,
# add that path here too.

# Prisma engine binary download cache — PRISMA_BINARY_CACHE_DIR is set (Render
# dashboard env var, not committed here) to a project-relative path so that
# `prisma generate`'s downloaded query-engine binaries land inside the
# directory tree Render actually promotes from its build step into the
# running instance, instead of the default ~/.cache/prisma-python/binaries/
# (a path on the build machine's own disk, confirmed via Render's own docs
# not to carry over to the runtime instance — architecture.md decision log).
# Never committed: platform-specific downloaded binaries, redownloaded fresh
# on every `prisma generate` run regardless of who/where runs it.
.prisma-binary-cache/
backend/.prisma-binary-cache/

